{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:42 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>《星島頭條》早前率先披露，MIRROR首位人夫邱士縉（Stanley）與李炘頤（Alina）將於本月底啟程前往東南亞舉行婚禮，及後《星島頭條》收到最新獨家消息，二人將於10月25日在峇里島舉行盛大婚禮。《星島頭條》今日（23日）獨家採訪三位在婚禮當天擔任兄弟團成員的Jeremy（李駿傑）、Jer（柳應廷）和Edan（呂爵安），還有出席婚禮的Anson Lo（盧瀚霆），他們一行人先後於清晨抵達機場，乘坐國泰航班飛往峇里島為婚禮作準備。</p>\n<h2>Jer喉嚨痛封嘴</h2>\n<p>Jer今日最早抵達機場與幾位助手在航班登記櫃位辦理登機手續，及後花姐（黃慧君）也抵達機場，之後Jer讓傳媒拍照，問他是否已經準備好做兄弟的工作？Jer沒有回應，只拱手示意並揮手表示不回答，問他是否身體不舒服？Jer表示，有點喉嚨痛，問到是否主角Stanley不允許透露行程？Jer只揮手及做出拉「掐嘴」手勢，示意要封嘴，再問他怕不怕會飲醉，因為女主角Alina準備了千杯不醉姊妹團？他繼續封嘴沒有回答。</p>\n<img alt=\"Jeremy抵達機場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6d87abb420538f469bc900b4334a7778/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_21_02_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Anson Lo抵達機場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/839fe03b806c3d134d3c19e2ba473e0f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_21_03_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Anson Lo同支持者揮手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/31b32b6ef2f14245f0c9449542678e16/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_21_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兄弟團成員Edan好笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/059e519a8dfe881110a88f69a21d7e82/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_21_05_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Edan、Anson Lo下車，同Fans打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ad9282ca77cb26e3da7283493d0a7194/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_21_05_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Anson Lo脫下口罩，同Fans打招呼兼入閘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d7666ecd887efbc7f0ed56470e5d3124/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_11_59.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jeremy、Edan、Anson Lo一齊行，好多Fans跟實。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6375901e644f288724c0ca442be8df17/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_12_01_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jeremy、Edan、Anson Lo合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8df8c06a5e0fb7dada7d2052c9278337/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_12_03_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"今朝機場特別熱鬧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/07e9f4cdcbd39f6bcfd837bd41cf5cd4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_12_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"準備上機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e9a9af6f97e58b728cf0225f68dacdc6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_12_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"行李都唔少。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b102dd6ed45dd11ff151e18afcbbde10/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_12_07_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"KB準備飛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b8450690b8bef46b0fa24e6480f6a850/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_12_07.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jer有啲唔舒服。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c1706f9a6a925e8dea61e695edf82318/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-23_at_10_12_09_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>Edan以笑代替回應</h2>\n<p>鼓手Kevin Boy（李健宏）與友人一起抵達機場出發到峇里島準備出席Stanley的婚禮。大約8時35分Jeremy、Anson Lo和Edan一齊抵達機場，吸引大班粉絲圍着他們拍照，三人只揮手與大家打招呼及讓傳媒拍照，在辦理登機櫃位確認身份後，他們便一起步入機場禁區準備登機，問Edan，Alina已準備好千杯不醉姊妹團對付他？Edan只報以笑聲沒有回答。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:03:52.187471+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":647,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:42:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:58:21.222617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:58:21.222617+00:00","content_hash":"c506bacf3ef829c383cc9ae902adbb18a0d8a2717d1cb46a7c3bdaa638dd6a46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}